  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Reshmi.P.R vs Vaikom Municipality on 5 July, 2024 Wp(C) No.14112/2019 1/3 Order Date : 05 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice M.A.Abdul Hakhim Friday, the 5th day of July 2024 / 14th Ashadha, 1946 Wp(C) No. 14112 Of 2019 Petitioner: Reshmi.P.R., Aged 48 Years, D/O. Late P.K. Raman Pulikal, Manapuram P.O., Cherthala, Alappuzha. Respondent: 1. Vaikom Municipality Represented By Secretary, Municipal Office, Vaikom, Pin-686141. 2. Food Safety Officer, Vaikom Circle, Thalappara, Thalayolapramabu P.O., Vaikom, Pin-686605. 3. Tahsildar, Vaikom Taluk, Vaikom, Pin-686141. 4. Addl . R4. Ramesh Babu, Aged 53 Years, S/O. P.K.Raman, Puthentharayil(Ram Nivas), Near Police Quarters, Vaikom, Pin-686141. 5. Addl. R5.Rema.P.R., Valakkotta House,,Udayamperoor P.O., Ernakulam District, Pin-682307. 6. Addl. R6.Remya.P.R., Sreedevi Sadanam, Avalookunnu.P.O., Punnamada Ward, Avalookunnu, Aleppey, Pin-688006. (Additional Respondents R4 To R6 Impleaded As Per Order Dated 02/11/2022 In Ia 2/2022. Writ petition (civil) praying inter alia that in the circumstances stated in the affidavit filed along with the Wp(C) the High Court be pleased to restraining the 1st respondent and officers under then from trespass and remove the structure put up by the petitioner in the property for which petitioner's father has got Ext.P1 patta, pending disposal of the Writ Petition (Civil). This petition coming on for orders upon perusing the petition and the affidavit filed in support of Wp(C) and upon hearing the arguments of Sri. M.S. Radhakrishnan Nair, Advocate for the petitioner, Sri. Sreekala A., Standing Counsel for R1, Government Pleader for R2 & R3 and of Sri. Dipu R., Advocate for R4 to R6, the court passed the following: Wp(C) No.14112/2019 2/3 Order Date M.A.Abdul Hakhim, J. ------------------------------------- W.P.(C)No.14112 of 2019 Reshmi.P.R vs Vaikom Municipality on 5 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/100427754/ 1 -------------------------------------- Dated this the 5th day of July, 2024 Order",
